<p>此异常脚踝处的文字在当天变为：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>from: SCP財団(JP)<br />
to: SCP基金会(CN)</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/4/27</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
